! Nadi_Chromatic.ascl
!
Nadi Chromatic in D# - Nadi (just intonation). All twelve just-intonation degrees Nadi uses. For Custom rasa, or free playing.
!
 12
!
 16/15
 9/8
 6/5
 5/4
 4/3
 45/32
 3/2
 8/5
 5/3
 9/5
 15/8
 2/1
!
! Scale degrees (the annotations that used to sit on the pitch lines):
!   re    111.73 cents
!   Re    203.91 cents
!   ga    315.64 cents
!   Ga    386.31 cents
!   Ma    498.04 cents
!   Ma+   590.22 cents
!   Pa    701.96 cents
!   dha   813.69 cents
!   Dha   884.36 cents
!   ni   1017.60 cents
!   Ni   1088.27 cents
!   Sa'  1200.00 cents
!
! Matches Nadi's internal tuning exactly, so instruments in this tuning
! and Nadi's resonators lock together instead of beating.
! Sattvagenic - sattvagenic.com/nadi
!
! @ABL NOTE_NAMES "Sa" "re" "Re" "ga" "Ga" "Ma" "Ma+" "Pa" "dha" "Dha" "ni" "Ni"
! @ABL REFERENCE_PITCH 3 0 311.126983
! @ABL SOURCE sattvagenic.com/nadi
